				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cunei,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 7, 4
						<i>med.</i></span></i>
			; cf.: minatius (i. e. miniaceus), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιλτωδης</span>, Gloss. Labb.</div>
